      "math_academy_id": "e-4434",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/a010c6dee215e0c6c31147a0f8a54534b9fa0e9866326349ef28d8477f61f811.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/e165377ecd826782ed4a4afd75155f869b66a3edbdd3ee9095a0f6ea1c93f0c3.svg)\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-2\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-10 \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
